      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SIMPLICITY MAGIC (2) stalked the pace from a low draw last start and fought on well to finish 3 lengths away in second (30.39) at Taree Super Track in a Grade 4/5 over 525m. Well placed and gets his chance. MAJOR FLIRT (1) turned in a plain run last time when seventh at Taree Super Track over 525m behind Kiarni Phoenix (30.86) in a Grade 4/5. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from six starts. Expected to feature in the finish. MODEST MAN (7) goes very well here starting 20 times for nine wins and eight minors. Below best last time at Grafton (25.69) in a NG, finishing a 7 length fourth. Can hit the frame with the right run. REAL BONNIE (6) scored last time and appeals as a top-three prospect.",
